      "title": "October Balance Changes",
      "publishDate": "2026-10-06T06:15:39.011Z",
      "category": "Clash Royale",
      "url": "https://supercell.com/en/games/clashroyale/blog/release-notes/october-balance-changes-2026",
      "thumbnail": "https://clashroyale.inbox.supercell.com/9jtsgmsiuthj/1ki2XGCEa3wGnjdbO5VS3v/81e0d15a5bcd79ae3dc7b9792e26c941/720x405.jpg",
      "isSmallNews": true,
      "highlights": [
        {
          "title": "",
          "text": "Balance Update \\u2013 October 19th With the Clash Royale League World Finals coming early November, we are implementing the seasonal November balance changes earlier, in mid-October, to allow time for players to adapt before the biggest competition of the year! NERFS \\u2b07\\ufe0f"
        },
        {
          "title": "Cannon Cart",
          "text": "Damage: 212 \\u2192 202 (-5%) Mass: 3 \\u2192 6 (+100%)"
        },
        {
          "title": "",
          "text": "Mortar decks are often impossible to break through, so we're targeting Cannon Cart to reduce the archetype's defensive potential. Cannon Cart will also no longer be pushed around by Goblins!"
        },
        {
          "title": "Dart Goblin",
          "text": "Damage: 151 \\u2192 143 (-5%)"
        },
        {
          "title": "",
          "text": "Dart Goblin is the common denominator among the stronger spell bait decks, so we're reducing his damage output and reducing the amount of Double Trouble gum allowed on him!"
        }
      ]
    },
